{#
  summarize.j2 — summarisation prompt.

  Purpose: instruct an agent to produce a structured summary of a subject.

  Required template_vars:
    subject          - what to summarize (string)

  Optional template_vars:
    length           - target length (string, e.g. "two paragraphs"); default "concise"
    submit_tool_name - name of the submit tool injected by the contract;
                       defaults to "submit" so this template renders standalone.
#}
Summarize: {{ subject }}.

Produce a {{ length | default('concise') }} summary. Lead with the answer, not the process. Drop filler — the reader wants signal, not narrative.

When done, call {{ submit_tool_name | default('submit') }} exactly once with the structured fields the contract requires.
